safix::bitwarden_stale

  × the vault's client could not refresh its local copy, so every bitwarden
  │ mapping was refused: none was read, judged or written.
  │ 
  │ The client's read commands answer from that local copy, and it may predate
  │ another device's change. Comparing against it would report agreement that
  │ is
  │ not there, and a backup mapping would write a value into an item that
  │ already holds one — which is the exact outcome backup's non-overwriting
  │ rule
  │ exists to prevent.
  │ 
  │ The client said:
  │ 
  │ Failed to sync: connect ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:8222
